  "description": "Bootstrap Icons pack for Lumeo — 2,078 fill-based 16x16 icons exposed as tree-shakeable Lumeo.IconSource properties on the flat `Bootstrap` class (namespace Lumeo.Icons). The `-fill` variants keep their suffix (Bootstrap's own naming, e.g. `BellFill`). Use with <SvgGlyph Svg=\"@(Bootstrap.Bell)\" /> or <Icon Svg=\"@(Bootstrap.HeartFill)\" />. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES: bundles the Bootstrap Icons set under the MIT license — see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the package.",
